<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

<title>Vancouver Current – Club Portal</title>

<style>
:root{
  /* Vancouver Current Identity: Moist Coastal, Quiet Pressure, Harbor Glow */
  --primary: #1F4B57;   /* deep teal */
  --accent:  #A8DADC;   /* muted cyan */
  --paper:   #ffffff;
  --ink:     #0f1214;

  --border-thick: 4px solid var(--ink);
  --border-thin:  1px solid #cfcfcf;

  --sans: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  --mono: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
}

body{
  background: #f4f6f7;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 20px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.club-sheet{
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  background: var(--paper);
  padding: 40px;
  border-top: var(--border-thick);
  position: relative;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}

/* DOC ID */
.doc-id{
  position: absolute;
  top: 15px;
  right: 20px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: #9aa3aa;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

/* HEADER */
header{
  border-bottom: var(--border-thick);
  padding-bottom: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.club-lockup{
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}

h1{
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 32px;
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.division-tag{
  background: var(--primary);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 12px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.fact-bar{
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #66727a;
  margin-top: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

/* CTAs */
.cta-row{
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 25px 0 40px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn{
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 180px;
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  padding: 12px 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn:hover{
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--ink);
}

.btn.primary{
  background: var(--primary);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--primary);
}

.btn.primary:hover{
  background: var(--accent);
  color: var(--ink);
  border-color: var(--accent);
}

/* SECTIONS */
section{ margin-bottom: 50px; }

h2{
  font-size: 14px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
  padding-bottom: 5px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

/* IDENTITY */
.identity p{
  font-size: 16px;
  max-width: 720px;
}

.identity ul{
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.identity li{
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-top: 1px solid #d7d7d7;
  padding-top: 10px;
}

/* IMAGE SLOTS */
.img-slot{
  background: #e7eaec;
  border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.img-slot img{
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

/* Aspect Ratios */
.ratio-16-9 { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
.ratio-3-4  { aspect-ratio: 3/4; max-width: 250px; }
.ratio-1-1  { aspect-ratio: 1/1; max-width: 260px; }

/* SPLIT */
.split{
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 30px;
}

/* ROSTER */
.roster{
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.roster td{
  padding: 10px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
}

.pos{
  font-family: var(--mono);
  color: var(--accent);
  width: 50px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* LINKS */
a{ color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover{ color: var(--primary); }

/* FOOTER */
.doc-footer{
  margin-top: 60px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  color: #9aa3aa;
  text-align: right;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

@media(max-width: 600px){
  .split{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .identity ul{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .doc-id{ display: none; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="club-sheet">

  <div class="doc-id">VCR-CLUB-01</div>

  <header>
    <div class="club-lockup">
      <h1>Vancouver Current</h1>
      <span class="division-tag">Americas Division</span>
    </div>

    <div class="fact-bar">
      <span>Est. —</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span><strong>The Current Grounds</strong></span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Mgr. Mara “Tidebook” Sato</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn primary" href="team.html?team=vancouver-current">Active Roster</a>
      <a class="btn" href="day.html?date=2026-05-12">Daily Scores</a>
      <a class="btn" href="game.html?date=2026-05-12&game=vancouver-current@spokane-alloys">Latest Box Score</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="identity">
    <h2>The Club</h2>
    <p>
      The Current plays like weather: slow arrival, constant pressure, no wasted motion. They don’t chase volume.
      They wait. They let at-bats lengthen until the air changes. Vancouver wins with soft contact, late counts,
      and mistakes the opponent can’t feel until it’s already on the ledger.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Style: Patience / Late Counts</li>
      <li>Vibe: Moist Quiet</li>
      <li>Tradition: “The Tide Pause”</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Ballpark</h2>
    <div class="img-slot ratio-16-9">
      <img src="club-vancouver-current-stadium.png" alt="The Current Grounds under harbor light and drizzle" />
    </div>
    <p>
      <strong>The Current Grounds.</strong> A compact park near the waterline where the seats never fully dry.
      On damp nights, the field lights reflect off concrete like a thin film. The wind off the harbor turns routine
      fly balls into private negotiations.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Broadcast</h2>
    <div class="split">
      <div class="img-slot ratio-3-4">
        <img src="club-vancouver-current-booth.png" alt="Broadcaster in a small booth with rain-streaked glass" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Clive Mercer</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Voice of the Current.</strong> Mercer calls games like he’s reading a tide chart aloud—measured,
          observational, never urgent. He trusts silence. When something big happens, he lowers his voice instead
          of raising it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Mascot & Stands</h2>
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <div class="img-slot ratio-1-1">
          <img src="club-vancouver-current-mascot.png" alt="Eddy, the Current’s quiet mascot presence" />
        </div>
        <h3>Eddy</h3>
        <p>
          A rain-slick, watchful presence in a simple rig—part seabird, part municipal worker, all patience.
          Eddy doesn’t hype the crowd. Eddy appears where the game feels thin.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="img-slot ratio-1-1">
          <img src="club-vancouver-current-fans.png" alt="Fans under umbrellas, standing quietly" />
        </div>
        <h3>The Umbrella Line</h3>
        <p>
          The standing section along the rail, shoulder-to-shoulder under umbrellas. They don’t chant.
          They listen. The loudest sound is rain on nylon until a strikeout lands—then a single, clean roar.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Core Roster</h2>
    <table class="roster">
      <tr><td class="pos">SS</td><td>Jonah “Stillwater” Keene</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="pos">C</td><td>Rafi “Backstop” Nadir</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="pos">P</td><td>Elena “Barometer” Ruiz</td></tr>
    </table>
  </section>

  <div class="doc-footer">
    GLB Club Portal · Vancouver · Internal
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
